# Website code

Apply when working under `src/` (app, components, lib, config, styles, etc.).

## Before coding

- Check `klugminds-handbook` → `docs/decisions/` for accepted stack/hosting choices
- Align with `klugminds-handbook` → `docs/branding/` and `standards/`

## Practices

- No secrets in source; use `.env.example` only
- Accessible, performant defaults; match brand tokens when defined
- Security headers live in `src/lib/security-headers.ts` — update when adding third-party scripts
- Add/update runbook in `klugminds-handbook` → `docs/runbooks/` before production deploy

## Scope

Implement only what the user requested; do not expand into unrelated site sections.
